{"id": "69121", "title": "重生之不要单恋", "author": "黑树", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69121.htm", "intro": "“你真勇敢，我就不敢跟我喜欢的人表白。”\r\n这句话注定了陶可终于由暗恋升级为单恋，这一恋就单了六年。\r\n本以为此生只能守着单恋默默过活，谁知道，一觉醒来她竟然回到了和康乐相遇的第一天……\r\n\r\n内容标签：高干 重生 情有独钟 都市情缘", "base": "files/article/html/69/69121", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10558835.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10558836.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10558837.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10558838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10558839.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10558840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10558841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10558842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10558843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10558844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10558845.html", "available": false}]}